{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Remember the sabbath day.</b> Be ever mindful of the sabbath day during your labors on the weekdays, as in זָכוֹר אֵת אֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה לְךָ עֲמָלֵק (Deuteronomy 25:17), שָׁמוֹר אֶת חֹדֶשׁ הָאָבִיב (Deuteronomy 16:1)." "<b>To sanctify it.</b> This you shall do in order that you may sanctify it. He cautioned that a person arrange his affairs on the weekdays, so that he can withdraw his mind from them on the sabbath day."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:29.468176954Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}